action_button_label = "Print Inscribed Glyph"
tooltip = "The masters of the studio are adept at reproducing scripture and paintings alike. By investing time and focus, scholars can find old teachings to print and spread among the populace.

Here you can print <term:craft>d <term:glyph>s and <term_lower:add_card> them to your <term:card_deck> if a given amount of <term:bonus.knowledge> has been reached on the shard.

[i]“What is written once may be forgotten; what is printed will travel.”[/i]"
